Z||000000||kornholio||08-09-99||08:47 PM||||Is it possible to put a spoiler on my car that has a luggage rack?  Or do I have to completely remove the luggage rack, have the holes filled and painted???  Thanks.
Z||000001||G25C||08-09-99||10:54 PM||||Im curious about this too.  My GT has a luggage rack, but i want the wing.  What has to be done to change the rack over to the wing?<br>
Z||000002||TOM||08-18-99||11:42 PM||||Remove the rack. Fill the holes with glass resin and paint. Drill and install the wing. You will also need the heavy trunk springs. I have one set if anybody is interested.
